{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 2562 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E5", "D4"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The product label for alprazolam (NDC 65862067799) identifies Aurobindo Pharma Limited (FEI 3007373532) as the registered manufacturing plant.",
      "cites": ["E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1105823 of that plant ended on 2019-09-27 and was classified Official Action Indicated (OAI), with the classification known to FDA on 2019-12-26.",
      "cites": ["E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That OAI classification occurred 2562 days before the shortage posting date of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E5", "D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A subsequent inspection (1169446) ended on 2022-05-10 and was classified Voluntary Action Indicated (VAI), known to FDA on 2022-08-04.",
      "cites": ["E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Current inventory across the three Corvale sites provides 20 to 27 days on hand at present usage rates.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The recommended action is to purchase from Amneal Pharmaceuticals LLC, which is not on FDA's shortage list today and operates the Amneal Pharmaceuticals of NY plant.",
      "cites": ["E1"]
    }
  ]
}
